stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Anonymous
  Anonymous --> Registering: /register
  Registering --> SignedIn: 201 + session cookie
  Anonymous --> SigningIn: /login
  SigningIn --> SignedIn: 200
  SigningIn --> SigningIn: 401 generic error
  Anonymous --> Resetting: /forgot-password
  Resetting --> Anonymous: token used, sessions revoked
  SignedIn --> Anonymous: Sign out (cookie cleared, IndexedDB cleared)
  SignedIn --> Anonymous: Session expired → redirect /login?next=…
  SignedIn --> [*]: Delete account
